    Bug 1926711 - Account Hub Font Awareness, sync lists should show ellipses and be the same size at larger font sizes, stack at 18px. r=aleca


    **How to Test**
    - Get to account sync lists at font size 17, update text in list items to be longer to see ellispis.
    - Delete account and set font-size to 18
    - Repeat process to get to sync lists
    - Sync lists should stack and condense height

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D238526

diff --git a/mail/components/accountcreation/content/widgets/email-sync-accounts-form.mjs b/mail/components/accountcreation/content/widgets/email-sync-accounts-form.mjs
index 6b60ce440bc..82f8dfeb2ba 100644
--- a/mail/components/accountcreation/content/widgets/email-sync-accounts-form.mjs
+++ b/mail/components/accountcreation/content/widgets/email-sync-accounts-form.mjs
@@ -124,6 +124,10 @@ class EmailSyncAccountsForm extends AccountHubStep {
    * @param {SyncAccounts} syncAccounts - The sync accounts for the user.
    */
   setState(syncAccounts) {
+    this.classList.toggle(
+      "stacked",
+      Services.prefs.getIntPref("mail.uifontsize") >= 18
+    );
     this.#availableSyncAccounts = syncAccounts;
     const calendars = syncAccounts.calendars;
     const addressBooks = syncAccounts.addressBooks;
